## 6. Sequence Reset (after loading seed data)

The schema script ends with this — re-run manually if you add/remove seed rows by hand:

```sql
SELECT setval('customers_customer_id_seq', (SELECT MAX(customer_id) FROM customers), true);
SELECT setval('accounts_account_id_seq', (SELECT MAX(account_id) FROM accounts), true);
SELECT setval('transactions_transaction_id_seq', (SELECT MAX(transaction_id) FROM transactions), true);
SELECT setval('audit_log_audit_id_seq', (SELECT MAX(audit_id) FROM audit_log), true);
```

