## 7. Before Connecting Your Backend Service

- [ ] Confirm each JPA/ORM entity's table-name mapping matches exactly: `customers`, `accounts`, `transactions`, `audit_log`
- [ ] Confirm enum values in code match the `CHECK` constraint values exactly (case-sensitive)
- [ ] Confirm `ddl-auto` (or equivalent) is set to `validate` or `none` in shared environments — not `update`/`create`, to avoid silently creating duplicate tables
- [ ] Confirm DB credentials/env vars point to `fincoredatabase`

